OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 86, dies in crash between car
OL,4,Aand van in Highlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 86-year-old man has died in a
OL,7,Ftwo-vehicle crash near Tain in the
OL,8,FHighlands.
OL,10,FPolice said the collision, which
OL,11,Fhappened on the A9 at Tarlogie at about
OL,12,F17:15 on Saturday, involved a white
OL,13,FPeugeot 208 and a white Renault Master
OL,14,FLuton van.
OL,16,FEmergency services attended but the
OL,17,FPeugeot driver was pronounced dead at
OL,18,Fthe scene. The van driver was taken to
OL,19,Fhospital with injuries that were not
OL,20,Flife-threatening.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
